    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 若初始状态为 $y(0^-) = 1, y'(0^-) = 1$ , 当输入 $f(t) = 2e^{-3t}u(t)$ 时, 求系统的全响应 $y(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            315,
            811,
            359
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：(1) 设中间变量 $q(1)$ ，如同文",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            364,
            526,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{则} 9 ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t |} & {= f | t | - 3 9 ^ {\\prime} | t | - 2 9 | t | \\Rightarrow f | t | = 9 ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 3 9 ^ {\\prime} | t | + 2 9 | t |} \\\\ {y | t |} & {= 9 | t | + 2 9 ^ {\\prime} | t |} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            228,
            408,
            830,
            498
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故系交微分方程为 $y^{i|t|} + 3y^{i|t|} + 2y^{i|t|} = 2f^{i|t|} + f^{i|t|}$",
        "bbox": [
            216,
            492,
            788,
            540
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} {(2) \\alpha^ {2} + 3 \\alpha + 2 = (\\alpha + 1) (\\alpha + 2) = 0} \\\\ {\\alpha_ {1} = - 1, \\quad \\alpha_ {2} = - 2} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            203,
            564,
            495,
            628
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {2 f (t) + f (t)} & {= 2 \\left[ - 6 e ^ {- 3 t} u (t) + 2 c (\\sqrt {t}) \\right] + 2 e ^ {- 3 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= - 1 0 e ^ {- 3 t} u (t) + 4 \\sqrt {t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            556,
            552,
            934,
            628
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {h} | t | = A e ^ {- t} + B e ^ {- 2 t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            243,
            629,
            438,
            666
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "t>0 时自由项 = -10e^{-3t} \\Rightarrow y\\_p(t) = ce^{-3t}",
        "bbox": [
            552,
            625,
            939,
            666
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {9 c e ^ {- 3 t} - 9 c e ^ {- 3 t} + 2 c e ^ {- 3 t}} & {= - 1 0 e ^ {- 3 t}} \\\\ {2 c = - 1 0 \\Rightarrow c = - 5} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            554,
