        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = 4\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            208,
            823,
